"help.message" = "Record a shortcut on the left. On the right, choose an installed app from the list or type an action manually.\n\napp:com.apple.mobilesafari\nLaunch the app, or bring its existing process to the foreground.\n\nshell:touch /var/mobile/test.txt\nRun a shell command as the mobile user.\n\nurl:https://example.com\nOpen a URL.\n\nwindow:left-half\nPlace the current window in the left half. Choose more layouts using the list button. Requires MacStatusBar&Dock.\n\nEach physical key press triggers once and is debounced. Shell commands can be dangerous—only enter commands you understand.";
